==Locations and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Bladed Rhino Beetle}}
Bladed Rhino Beetles can be found on [[Tree]]s in the [[Region]] of [[Necluda]]. They can be combined with [[Monster Part]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make a [[Mighty Elixir]], which grants [[Attack Up]] when consumed.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] accepts Bladed Rhino Beetles as an ingredient to make [[Navy Dye]].

If [[Link]] approaches [[Beedle]] with at least one Bladed Rhino Beetle in his [[Inventory]], Beedle will offer to trade it in exchange for a Mighty Elixir.<ref name="BotW Beedle"/> If Link agrees to the trade, Beedle promises to cherish it for the rest of his life.<ref name="BotW Beedle 2"/> Beedle will also be happy, remarking that he is adding it to his Beetle collection.<ref name="BotW Beedle 3"/> When Link speaks to Beedle afterwards, he claims to still be excited about the Beetle.<ref name="BotW Beedle 4"/> He claims that if Link has another, he should give it to him tomorrow, as he is going to be focusing on his new Beetle for the rest of the day.<ref name="BotW Beedle 5"/> If Link refuses, Beedle states that he misjudged Link's character.<ref name="BotW Beedle 6"/>

